ersion on Windows OS.\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\nAll tests annotated with @QuarkusTest failed with since Quarkus version 1.1.0.Final.\r\nError trace:\r\n`\r\n[ERROR] Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 1, Skipped: 0, Time elapsed: 32.599 s <<< FAILURE! - in org.acme.ExampleResourceTest\r\n[ERROR] testHelloEndpoint  Time elapsed: 22.575 s  <<< ERROR!\r\njava.net.ConnectException: Connection timed out: connect\r\n        at org.acme.ExampleResourceTest.testHelloEndpoint(ExampleResourceTest.java:15)\r\n`\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Go to 'https://code.quarkus.io/' page\r\n2. Click on \"Generate your application\" and download the archive\r\n3. Extract zip on Windows OS\r\n4. Execute the following maven command: 'mvnw test'\r\n\r\n**Configuration**\r\nDefault properties file generate in 'https://code.quarkus.io/' page.\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\nNA\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Windows 7+ \r\n - Java version:\r\n`$ java -version\r\njava version \"1.8.0_241\"\r\nJava(TM) SE Runtime Environment (build 1.8.0_241-b07)\r\nJava HotSpot(TM) 64-Bit Server VM (build 25.241-b07, mixed mode)`\r\n - Quarkus version since 1.0.1.Final \r\n - Build tool: \r\n`$ mvnw --version\r\nApache Maven 3.6.3 (cecedd343002696d0abb50b32b541b8a6ba2883f)\r\nMaven home: C:\\Users\\nmdm7478\\.m2\\wrapper\\dists\\apache-maven-3.6.3-bin\\1iopthnavndlasol9gbrbg6bf2\\apache-maven-3.6.3\r\nJava version: 1.8.0_231, vendor: Oracle Corporation, runtime: C:\\Java\\oracle\\jdk1.8.0_231\\jre\r\nDefault locale: fr_FR, platform encoding: Cp1252\r\nOS name: \"windows 10\", version: \"10.0\", arch: \"amd64\", family: \"windows\"`\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/7699/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/7699/timeline","